title: mf context parent
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Event log]]
kind: reference
summary: Print the context the current one is in, as new prints it; 0 at the root

Prints the parent of the context `METAFOLDER_LOG_CONTEXT` passes on, as
[[mf context new]] prints a context (`<repo uuid>:<id>`); `0` when the current context
is a root, or when there is none. A script leaving a nested context goes back with
`export METAFOLDER_LOG_CONTEXT=$(mf context parent)` ([[Log contexts]]).
